{"tool_name":"lymphatic-vessel-density-calculation","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This article Baslat et al. presents a method to compute Lymphatic Vessel Density on an image of the whole slide (a workflow documented as&nbsp;text).</p>\n\n<p>Vessels are obtained with a Maximum Entropy Thresholding applied on the excess Red channel (2 times the red values minus blue+green value). Stroma tissue is obtained with a Moment Preserving Thresholding on the blue channel.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This article Baslat et al. presents a method to compute Lymphatic Vessel Density on an image of the whole slide (a workflow documented as&nbsp;text).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Vessels are obtained with a Maximum Entropy Thresholding applied on the excess Red channel (2 times the red values minus blue+green value). Stroma tissue is obtained with a Moment Preserving Thresholding on the blue channel.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-04-28T21:25:31+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T12:09:05+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4457,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ab9aa26e-5c3b-429d-a0b5-9bded86673f6","url":"/taxonomy/term/4457"},{"target_id":4458,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"1403b8e7-4fa2-4ead-a823-e1a594a2b577","url":"/taxonomy/term/4458"},{"target_id":4459,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"657d8ffd-3493-49be-8a8f-7cde05941f1d","url":"/taxonomy/term/4459"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505205350,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"C\u00e9dric Balsat"},{"value":"Nicolas Signolle"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4460,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"705221a6-1c79-4639-9b9b-26600d62e881","url":"/taxonomy/term/4460"}],"has